Subject: Retain original vertex animation resources and frame stream descriptors
Upstream-base: a8187061af65aa2022bfd8dc2e32163089ea0090

Select original GLVertexAnim construction, update and frame binding; pair its
stream-ID allocation with nlFree and privately copy only rebound descriptors.
Extend native GL inventory with original Add/Get and genuine owned teardown.
The original aggregate UpdateVertexAnims remains unselected: its current-level
